title: Bath3B
---
// Talk target of the bathroom door in 3B (Hotspots layer). See window_3b.yarn.
-> Look
    <<if can("R1Viewing", "bath")>>
        <<done R1Viewing bath>>
        <<face Samantha Player>>
        // PLACEHOLDER lines.
        <<if not is_done("R1Viewing", "window") and not is_done("R1Viewing", "kitchen")>>
            {$samantha_name}: The bathroom first. Practical. Or nervous.
        <<endif>>
        {$samantha_name}: The hot water takes a minute. Don't stand there waiting for it, it hates that.
        {$samantha_name}: So. You just finished?
        You: Last month. This would be my first flat.
        {$samantha_name}: I can tell.
        <<if can("R1Viewing", "flat")>>
            <<note r1_view "Tell Samantha you've seen enough.">>
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif in_box("R1Viewing")>>
        You: The hot water takes a minute. Apparently.
    <<else>>
        You: The bathroom. The hot water still takes a minute.
    <<endif>>
===
